<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Calm</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 12, up to 80%), Druid (guild level 26, up to 50%), Paladin (guild level 28, up to 50%)
Also taught by: Kaare, in the back room of the inn in Udgaard (anyone, up to 35%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast calm &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>Soothes a frightened mind. It ends the fear spell on the target, and stops 
cause panic if your spell is at least as strong as what is left of the 
panic, so they no longer flee in terror. On someone who isn't afraid, 
nothing happens. It doesn't help against confusion.
</p><p>You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on potions and 
scrolls. Practising it needs divine 56.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fear</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cause Panic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>